WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.670
Tags help describe a ticket without changing its category.

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:09.050
In Resolution Center, find Add Tag and enter a short, consistent label for the issue.

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:10.700
Press Enter to save.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:14.240
Open Details and check that the label appears under Tags.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:19.255
A tag adds context to the record; it is not a new priority or a status change.
